### ex_quiddity ###
# The compiled NIF belongs to the machine that built it.
/priv/native/
# Where a test that names a temporary directory writes.
/tmp/
# Anything a generator here writes at run time, never committed.
/priv/trained/
# A package built by `mix hex.build`.
/ex_quiddity-*.tar
# The log of a CI run watched from here.
/.ci/
